# Minimal reproducer for the checkBonds partner-type out-of-bounds read.
#
# The rule's reactant pattern bonds A to C at C's FOURTH component (index 3).
# The seed species bonds A to B, which has ONE component. Matching the A
# template against that molecule makes checkBonds index the B molecule with the
# C template's component index 3 -- two slots past the end of B's bond array.
begin model
begin parameters
  k 1
end parameters
begin molecule types
  A(s)
  B(x)
  C(x,y,z,w)
end molecule types
begin seed species
  A(s!1).B(x!1) 100
  C(x,y,z,w)     100
end seed species
begin observables
  Molecules Abound A(s!+)
  Molecules Cfree  C(w)
end observables
begin reaction rules
  A(s!1).C(w!1) -> A(s) + C(w) k
end reaction rules
end model
begin actions
writeXML()
end actions
